IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDECODE-V13.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-WARPS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TILE-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDECODE-V13.
    IF NUM-WARPS == 0 OR TILE-DIM == 0 OR SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 43400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-WARPS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
